  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The purpose of this data was to examine whether alder seedling establishment success changes along a topographical gradient. This study was established to address the hypothesis that lower slope positions would have greater recruitment; a hypothesis based on the observation that valley bottoms and drainages are commonly the most productive sites for shrub expansion."
